&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;l&lt;/span&gt; Growth mindset, company-wide perspective. Focus on business problem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;solving, and data-driven&lt;/p&gt;
