&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*SIGN ON BONUS- $5,000 being offered*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Director – Home Health&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking an experienced and dynamic Executive Director to lead our Erie, Pennsylvania Home Health office. This Medicare-certified intermittent skilled care office has proudly served the community for the past two years, providing short-term nursing, rehabilitative, therapeutic, and supportive home health services to adults and seniors through personalized one-hour in-home visits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leadership role is ideal for a motivated healthcare professional who is passionate about clinical excellence, team development, operational leadership, and growing community partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire, and motivate clinical and office teams to deliver exceptional patient care and service excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with employees, referral sources, physicians, and community partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee daily office operations, including business development, budgeting, strategic planning, recruiting, and fiscal management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with Medicare Conditions of Participation and all regulatory standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the quality and appropriateness of patient care services to support positive outcomes and client satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise and support a team of field nurses and therapists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct supervisory visits in patient homes as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate new hire orientation and provide ongoing training and mentorship for clinical staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and deliver educational in-services and staff development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 1 year of healthcare management experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Home Health and OASIS experience required (minimum 1 year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Medicare Conditions of Participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acute care, medical-surgical, and/or sub-acute experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to achieve goals, lead teams, and successfully manage increasing levels of responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership, communication, and relationship-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Offers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
